            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "p21-q6-short-method",
            "type": "paragraph",
            "fontSize": null,
            "align": "left",
            "spaceBefore": 0,
            "spaceAfter": 2,
            "lineHeight": 1.4,
            "indent": 0,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Add their speeds to find the separation rate, then use Olivia's speed over the resulting time.",
                "marks": []
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "worked": "They move apart at the sum of their speeds.\n$$\\begin{align*}s_{\\text{relative}} &= 3+2 = 5\\text{ m/s}\\\\t &= \\frac{100}{5} = 20\\text{ seconds}\\\\d_{\\text{Olivia}} &= st\\\\d_{\\text{Olivia}} &= 3\\times20\\\\d_{\\text{Olivia}} &= 60\\text{ m}\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
